+  linked and bound.
+- **adopt** (boolean, default `false`): manage the gadget in place while it
+  stays bound, instead of only protecting it.
+- **config** (string): the configuration directory to manage, for example
+  `c.1`. Only needed when the gadget has more than one configuration.
+- **keep_identity** (boolean, default `true`): never write the gadget's
+  vendor and product IDs, `bcdDevice`, device class or strings. Only `true`
