+  adopted, only protected.
+- **allowed_modes** (list of USB modes): the modes an adopted gadget may be
+  switched to. `get_modes` offers only these.
+
+Merge rules across files:
+
+- `pinned_functions`: the union. A later file can add pins but never remove
+  one. Mask the file that added a pin (a same-named symlink to `/dev/null`) to
+  drop it.
+- `allowed_modes`: the intersection of every file that sets it.
+- `adopt`, `config`, `keep_identity`: the last file that sets the key wins.
 
